# 3-bed / 2-bath with a hallway spine — the classic barndo split: open
# living/kitchen/dining up front, a 4 ft hall feeding the bedrooms. bed1 and bed2
# sit either side of a stacked pair of square walk-in closets, so the closets
# buffer sound between the sleeping rooms (no shared bedroom wall). The primary
# suite has a private ensuite (back-to-back with the hall bath on a wet wall) and
# a walk-in; its door is at the east end of the hall and bed1's at the west end,
# so the corridor terminates at doorways, not blank walls. Exterior dims are on
# the 3 ft build module.
plan "Birch Hollow"
envelope 69 x 33
ceiling 10
program 3 bed 2 bath
require adjacent kitchen dining

# --- public band (south, y 0..15) ---
room living:  living  at 0,0   size 27 x 15
room kitchen: kitchen at 27,0  size 20 x 15
room dining:  dining  at 47,0  size 22 x 15

# --- the spine: 4 ft, ending at the master door ---
room hall: hallway at 0,15 size 63 x 4

# --- west: bed1 + bed2 flanking a stacked pair of square walk-in closets ---
room bed1:    bedroom at 0,19   size 13 x 14
room closet1: closet  at 13,19  size 6 x 7
room closet2: closet  at 13,26  size 6 x 7
room bed2:    bedroom at 19,19  size 13 x 14

# --- centre: shared hall bath ---
room bath1: bathroom at 32,19 size 9 x 14

# --- east: primary suite (ensuite backs onto the hall bath; walk-in caps the
#     NE corner so the hall needn't run past the master door) ---
room mbath:   bathroom at 41,19 size 6 x 14
room master:  bedroom  at 47,19 size 16 x 14
room mcloset: closet   at 63,15 size 6 x 18

open living - kitchen width 10
open kitchen - dining width 10
open living - hall width 4
door hall - bed1 width 3 offset 0.5
door hall - bed2 width 3 offset 0.5
door hall - bath1 width 2.67 offset 3
door hall - master width 3 offset 12.5
door bed1 - closet1 width 2.5 offset 0.5 into bed1
door bed2 - closet2 width 2.5 offset 0.5
door master - mbath width 2.67 offset 0.5 into mbath
door master - mcloset width 2.5 offset 10.5 into master

entry living south width 3 offset 20
entry dining east width 3 offset 6
window living south width 10 offset 2
window kitchen south width 8 offset 6
window dining south width 8 offset 6
window bed1 north width 5 offset 4
window bed2 north width 5 offset 4
window master north width 6 offset 6
window bath1 north width 3 offset 2 sill 5
window mbath north width 3 offset 1 sill 5

# Smoke alarms: one in every bedroom plus the hall outside the sleeping rooms
# (IRC R314); the bath windows are high privacy transoms clear of the tubs.
alarm smoke in bed1
alarm smoke in bed2
alarm smoke in master
alarm smoke in hall
